    <span class="grid gap-2"><span class="font-stretch-84% text-caption leading-none tracking-ui text-quiet">Desktop 1280px</span><img class="block h-auto w-full border border-rule" src="/images/articles/layout-across-widths/govuk-question-page-1280.webp" alt="幅1280pxの質問ページ．左寄せの見出しと4つの選択肢，Continueボタンだけが並び，右側の半分以上は空いている．" width="1280" height="491" loading="lazy" /></span>
