          <span class="flex justify-between pb-2 font-stretch-84% text-caption leading-none tracking-ui text-quiet [border-block-end:var(--border-width-rule)_solid_var(--color-line)]"><span>No. 07</span><span>Travel</span></span>
          <span class="text-5xl leading-tight font-strong">週末は灯台のある港町へ</span>
